# Installation job playbooks.
#
# A playbook placed here (`<job>.md`) is dispatchable through the supervisor
# webhooks exactly like the bundled jobs in the parent dir:
# agent/supervisor/http-server.mjs resolves {"job": "<name>"} to
# jobs/<name>.md first, then to jobs/_ext/<name>.md (a kernel job wins on a
# name), and appends agent/local/jobs/<name>.md when that exists. Give a new
# job a tier in agent/local/job-routing.json and a schedule in
# agent/local/tasks.json (both merged with the kernel's by lib/registry.cjs).
#
# Everything here except this file is gitignored — see .gitignore and
# docs/architecture-public-private.md.
